    "created_at": "2023-02-13T15:30:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-13T15:30:00Z",
    "body": "I think the issue is that `summary` is exposed as a button in the a11y tree, and buttons can only have plain text. So long as that is the case we can't allow headings (same as with `button` element).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
