    "updated_at": "2024-08-15T15:37:53Z",
    "body": "Headings in `<summary>` have been allowed for about a decade at least. That is they have been valid for as log as the Internet Archive's Wayback Machine reaches back for the currently relevant spec page: https://web.archive.org/web/20141013114912/https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-summary-element",
